<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">John Thumna</book>
  <para style="h">John Thumna</para>
  <para style="toc1">John Thumna</para>
  <para style="toc2">John Thumna</para>
  <para style="mt">John Thumna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawlpi Upa keima in — Ka it takpi ka lawm Gaius tungah lai kong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka it ka lawmpa awng, thaa sungah thahat ci in kong heak bangma — na theampo ah maapai daupai in na ciidam natu thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thumaan thutak sungah a nungta tawntung na hi bangma — Tapidaw suapui pawlkhat hong theng a, nang sia thumaan thutak sungah takkha hi ci in hong son ciang ka lungdam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tate thumaan thutak sungah a nuntak ka zaak sia sangin hong lungdamsak zaw thei a dang bangma a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka it ka lawmpa awng, na Tapidaw puite khualmi ahi laitak ngawngawn zong amate a tu nasepna ah thumaan in citak ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate na itna thu teng hi sung pawlpi ah hong ko uh hi. Amate khualhawna sungah Pathian lungkim zia taw a paitan thei natu in na hu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate sia Christ ii na seamin khual a haw uh ciang, thu um ngawlte tung pan huna bangma saang ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom ei Tapidawte in hi mihingte ii thumaan thutak a tu a sepna sungah a seppui ih hi thei natu in ih hu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawlpi tungah laithak tomno khat ka at hi; ahihang amate ih lampui a suak nuam Diotrephes in kei ii ci bang sia hong thupi sim bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom kong pai ciangin ama ngamtatna theampo: ko thu a cizathuai a hong sonte le a leilotna teng ka pholaak tu hi! Ahihang tua teng bek hi ngawl lai hi; Tapidaw suapuite hong pai ciangin saang nuam ngawlin, tuabang a saang nuamte ngawngawn tho in, biakinn pan hawlkeak tu hanciam lai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka it ka lawmpa awng, a pha ngawlte zui heak vun a, a phate zui tavun. Thupha vawt peuma Pathian neisa hi a; thusia vawt peuma in Pathian a mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Demetrius sia ngual theampo in phat son hi; thumaan thutak mama in ama phat son hi. Tuaciang ko zongh in tetti ka pang thua uh a, thumaan son ka hi uh sia na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kong son nop tam mama om ahihang laikung laite taw kong at nuam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />No taw kimu pal tu in lametna ka nei a, tua hun ciangin maitang kisi in ih son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thinnopna nga tavun. Na ngualtamhte theampo in nuksetna kam hong thaak hi. Ko ii lawm teng zongh maitang kisi in na nukset sak vun.
  </para>
</usx>
